<doc node='afc77a21-4a57' rev='2'><paragraph id='mttvddjsrgd.0' rev='1' h='aedb28b5' heading='1'><text id='.1'>Infrastructure and services</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.29' rev='2' h='6b9b4abf'><text id='.30'>Most infrastructure can be made PQ by configuration you control today; a few legs are blocked until AWS ships support. Each sub-page has status, detection, steps and enforcement for one area.</text></paragraph><table id='.221' h='7f2a6543'><row id='.222' h='770b48d8'><cell id='.223' h='ad5ded1f' header='true'><paragraph id='.224' h='024dc204'><text id='.225'>Area</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.229' h='1287f619' header='true'><paragraph id='.230' h='06a8a77f'><text id='.231'>PQ today</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.239' h='39db772e' header='true'><paragraph id='.240' h='c64ab02a'><text id='.241'>Main action</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.252' h='46de4945' header='true'><paragraph id='.253' h='722d39f0'><text id='.254'>Blocked by AWS</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.268' h='0606441c'><cell id='.269' h='1d256e34'><paragraph id='.270' h='5beeee9e'><text id='.271'>Load balancers</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.285' h='5c946d99'><paragraph id='.286' h='1b76406e'><text id='.287'>ALB and NLB opt-in; Classic none</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.319' h='e7f46871'><paragraph id='.320' h='cbc8c21a'><text id='.321'>Set the 2025-09 PQ policy; SCP on the policy condition key</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.379' h='32e1c943'><paragraph id='.380' h='8a9bb593'><text id='.381'>Classic LB (migrate)</text></paragraph></cell></row><row id='.401' h='489c7538'><cell id='.402' h='14b7a0ee'><paragraph id='.403' h='c2c20d52'><text id='.404'>Edge and API front doors</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.428' h='c31073c7'><paragraph id='.429' h='9e4110ca'><text id='.430'>CloudFront viewer on; API Gateway REST opt-in</text></paragraph></cell><cell id='.475' h='66d40650'><paragraph id='.476' h='46b4e582'><text id='.477'>Set REST PQ policies; front HTTP and